{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46829","headline":"荆渚感怀寄僧达禅弟三首 一 · 齐己","name":"荆渚感怀寄僧达禅弟三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"电击流年七十三，齿衰气沮竟何堪。\n谁云有句传天下，自愧无心寄岭南。\n晓漱气嫌通市井，晚烹香忆落云潭。\n邻峯道者应弹指，藓剥藤缠旧石龛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}